<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND SET ENGLAND 305 TO WIN 3RD TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND SET ENGLAND 305 TO WIN 3RD TEST.</headline>
<dateline>CHRISTCHURCH 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were all out for 186 in their second innings at lunch on the fourth day of their third and final cricket test against England on Monday, setting England a total of 305 to win.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 346 (S. Fleming 62, R. Croft 5-95) and 186 (C. Cairns 52, D. Vettori 29 not out).</p>
<p>England first innings 228 (M. Atherton 94 not out, G. Allot 4-74).</p>
</text>
